{"id":102207721832796,"type":"artist","name":"Don Henley","artist":null,"year":1947,"weight":50,"info":{"country":"US","begin":"1947-07-22","kind":"Person","similar":["Glenn Frey","John Mellencamp","Eddie Money","Steve Winwood","Bob Seger & The Silver Bullet Band","Jackson Browne","Eagles","Bruce Hornsby & the Range","REO Speedwagon",".38 Special"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Don_Henley_%28cropped%29.jpg?width=500","bio":"Bateria de \"Eagles\", cantante y compositor, es autor de la célebre canción \"Hotel california\", a la que pone su voz desde la batería.\n\nCuando Don Henley con Glen Frey, Bernie Leadon y Randi Meisner se unieron para grabar su sonido con tintes rock y country no sospechaban que los Eagles se convertirían en uno de los grupos esenciales de la música americana. Sus Desperado, Take easy. Take it to the limit, Tequila Sunrise, Hotel California...son escuchados cada día en cualquier parte del mundo.","tags":["classic rock","rock","80s","singer-songwriter","soft rock"]},"works":[{"id":265301572862899,"type":"song","name":"Dirty Laundry","artist":"Don Henley","year":1983,"weight":4,"yt":"bsRTsiKPI2M","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":120682792121633,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1983","rank":48,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","rank":48,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":66866348327877,"type":"song","name":"All She Wants to Do Is Dance","artist":"Don Henley","year":1985,"weight":4,"yt":"eud5AurOxm0","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":112464446304388,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1985","rank":97,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","rank":97,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":174801716516267,"type":"song","name":"The Boys of Summer","artist":"Don Henley","year":1985,"weight":6,"yt":"6RUIeX6UCT8","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":1124644